[Desktop Entry]
Name=FluidSur-dark
Name[zh_CN]=FluidSur 暗色
Comment=FluidSur dark desktop theme for KDE Plasma
Comment[zh_CN]=FluidSur KDE Plasma 暗色桌面主题
Encoding=UTF-8
Keywords=Desktop;Workspace;Appearance;Look and Feel;Logout;Lock;Suspend;Shutdown;Hibernate;
